{"server":"cn","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_03_end","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_03","title":"恶客盈门","storyCode":"PV-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"3283eb75c44b470211fd06498854fb735d7b2dcd44eabf0961ac8ec184720ad3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"拉维妮娅与德米特里在酒庄碰面，怀疑德米特里与车祸有关，却偶遇前来打听消息的英格丽，杀手与法官因此相识。拉维妮娅在英格丽离开后，得知对方在车祸当晚曾出现在案发现场。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g12_saluzzowinery"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月6日    8:20 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我推荐你尝尝这一款“酸红舌苔”，据说是从萨米弄回来的方子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察B","speakerId":"avg_npc_702_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你疯了，马内？让其他客人看到我们在酒庄里点了调制酒，结账走人之前我们会一直被嘲笑的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，可我们上个月在哥伦比亚旅游的时候不是刚刚尝过类似的酒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有点怀念我们的蜜月了，亲爱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（别忘了老师在警校教的卧底课程，有时候我们反而得显眼些，帮其他人打打掩护。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大法官安排其他人把无关人员请离还需要时间。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察B","speakerId":"avg_npc_702_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......真不是你自己想要喝？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我发誓，亲爱的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察B","speakerId":"avg_npc_702_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭、闭嘴......小声点，马内！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为他的新沃尔西尼会更加宽容些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女士，如果你愿意，我可以请你喝一杯酒。当然，也是调制酒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就当是入乡随俗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察B","speakerId":"avg_npc_702_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（马内，他过来了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，谢谢你的好意，但还轮不到你请我的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想你误会了，警察先生，我要请的人不是你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿意坐下喝一杯吗？你在黑暗的角落里站了很久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚还在想，到底要多长时间你才会想结账走人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这，我不用结账。萨卢佐从不亏待他们邀请的贵客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"况且我来之前，阿尔贝托就给所有属于他的酒庄提前打好了招呼。“请随意品鉴”，他的原话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前从来不知道，你和萨卢佐家族关系这么好。你和阿尔贝托有什么合作？总不会是在这里当调酒师吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i30"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅，我不是来接受你的审讯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很在意莱昂的状况，这是我们今晚在这里碰面的唯一原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“他还在昏迷”“他还没摆脱生命危险”......你期望听到什么样的答案？还是说，你害怕听到什么样的答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天愿意来见我，至少说明，情况没有到最差的那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还是不能见他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用问你明知道答案的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂是我的兄弟，我希望他平安，就是这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是你的兄弟，还是贝洛内家族的叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅，贝洛内家族每一个留下的人，都有理由恨他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也恨他，我不认同莱昂当初的选择和如今的做法，但我不会用如此下作的手段对付他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些话不能成为你洗脱嫌疑的证词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂是在与你碰面之前出事的，你当时就坐在离案发现场不远的餐厅里。你的嫌疑极大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，拉维妮娅法官，你准备怎么做？你想把我押回去再慢慢审问？我知道在座的许多“客人”都是警察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在没有明确证据之前，我不会抓捕你。这就是法律的意义，和家族的“规则”不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我对你的疑虑不会消除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会查到的，不论你有没有做什么，不论是谁卷入其中。我一定会查清楚真相。"},{"type":"narration","text":"德米特里看着拉维妮娅坚定的眼神，叹了一口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅，你一点也没变，还是当初那个刚当上法官，就敢当面质问首领的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直没那么喜欢你，但......谢谢你替我照顾莱昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我还是要说。关于莱昂的意外，我和你一样想要知道凶手是谁......我也会去验证。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"德米特里取过一直放在旁边的一瓶酒，轻轻拔下塞子。\n瓶子里晃晃荡荡的，只剩了小半瓶酒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别人送我的酒，本来是打算请莱昂的。本来坐在这的，应该是他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，这杯就算我请你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅，我真不能见他？"},{"type":"narration","text":"他靠在桌边，等待着拉维妮娅的回答。\n但法官看着眼前杯中的红酒，没有说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。那我继续待在这也没什么意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在离开，各位应该不会拦我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你准备用《新都市管理法案》中审查家族的特别程序扣留我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经没有家族了，德米特里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我是不是应该走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是这么随性啊，老威尼斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去港口迎接你的手下，知道他们的家主此刻正坐在这么普通的餐厅吃饭吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是想念这里的食物。谁又能想到，来到新沃尔西尼，迎接我的第一个人是你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，快坐下吧，我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家餐厅可不能算普通，这里的厨师是我从西西里找来的，最地道的红烩肉酱的滋味，你应该尝尝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人喜欢把未来挂在嘴上，不是坏事。但有些传统不该被丢掉，尤其是关于叙拉古食物的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有人提出在萨卢佐家酿酒的配方上搞创新，应该会被直接埋进葡萄园里当肥料吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这瓶贵腐酒是我们新典藏酒的第一支，算是给你接风洗尘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......1069年，是个好年份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我的酒架上能找到萨卢佐酒业所有子品牌和年份的酒，但距离你上一次亲自送我酒，已经过去很久了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的联系并不多，阿尔贝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十年而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了独占城市的源石贸易，莫雷蒂家族罔顾十二家族不得互相倾轧的规则，对我们进行大肆打压......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯家族愿意在那时站出来居中调停，当然值得萨卢佐的尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“大肆打压”——是我年纪大了，记忆有了偏差？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么记得那起纷争最后的结果，是莫雷蒂家族在叙拉古彻底消失呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你吞下了他们的源石生意，坐稳了灰厅的椅子，才有了萨卢佐家族如今在叙拉古的地位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的事情你经历得不比我少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你我的联系不多，倒是一件好事，没人知道西西里夫人会怎么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连狂欢节这曾经被她亲自取缔的节日，如今也能复活......或许她对叙拉古，比你我、比灰厅所有人想象的都要更加包容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一座最新的城市，庆祝一个最古老的节日，不容错过，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市政厅的那群年轻人，不过是想用这种形式告诉所有人，叙拉古将发生彻底的改变......从这里开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我突然想到了已经死去的贝纳尔多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一个愚蠢且自以为是的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么评价一位故去的老朋友可有些不太礼貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才看着外面卡车来来往往，警察在指挥交通，哪怕是没戴面具的行人，也分不清哪些是家族成员哪些是普通人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里甚至连天气都比其他城市要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，或许家族并不会如贝纳尔多所愿真的消失......但要不是你出现在我的面前，我甚至怀疑这里还是不是叙拉古。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯家族可是融入得很不错，老威尼斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从新地块的建设，到新政府的筹备，你们从头到尾都没有露过面，但新沃尔西尼正式运行后，你们突然加快了动作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是安东那孩子在负责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的女婿确实很有手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯载具公司至今没有过违反《新都市管理法案》的记录，他甚至还会配合市政厅调查其他家族的违法事实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人总是比我们更主动地融入新时代嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可家族的底色从不会因为岁月变迁而被磨灭，老威尼斯。你比我更清楚，你们的载具公司私下在做什么生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们的闲话也只能聊到这了。阿尔贝托，我还在想，你什么时候才能忍不住和我聊正事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你已经知道我要说什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古的新鲜事没那么多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你从谁那知道了些什么，想要做什么，我这个老头子可能都插不上什么手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找市政厅，还是找安东，威胁也好，合作也罢，这些都与我无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时代确实在变化，我谈不上喜欢或者讨厌，但我确实阻止不了这种趋势。那不如放手把未来交给年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怕被年轻人给带进沟里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何不等等看呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯家族能在短短三代人手上崛起，靠的从来都不是所谓老一辈的坚持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的家里有沃尔珀，有佩洛，有没有血缘关系的鲁珀。正因为我们能够毫无芥蒂地接纳任何有想法的人加入，才能走到如今。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在做的事，与当年我的家主所做的事别无二致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这趟过来，只是为了感受一下节日的氛围——不过见到的第一个人是你，我还是很开心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们这样的老家伙，终究还是需要体面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“体面”，你还是爱把这个词挂在嘴边，老威尼斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯家族能聚而不散，可全仰仗这一个词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老威尼斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1545_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们知道什么事可以做，什么事不能做，为的是自己的体面，也是家族的体面。阿尔贝托，你觉得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是别人，我会说都是屁话。但如果是你说的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能承认，“在叙拉古，这的确是很珍贵的东西。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"介意请我吃一份肉酱面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看这瓶贵腐酒也别想着带回蒙特卢佩了，就在这开了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你吃得香，难免也有些馋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，往后还能这么安静地坐在一起吃饭的机会，恐怕不多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"narration","text":"翁贝托工作时从不需要看时间。\n他默数着缝纫机针头的每一次起落，在告别了过去的生活之后，这就是他最喜欢的度过每分每秒的方式。\n但现在，他却害怕起针头起起落落的声音。\n刚刚在煎熬之中度过了漫长的一天，老人的眼睛肿胀得难受，但他必须靠缝纫这件事来强迫自己提起精神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢奇诺，是你吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翁贝托先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，安娜，是你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，我来取上个月定做的套装。明天我就能去市政厅正式工作了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，卢奇诺不在店里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......有事出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜，稍等，我去把你的套装取来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"试试，觉得怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好合身！谢谢您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢什么，你可是付了钱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您用了更好的料子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市政厅的通知你等了那么久，这份工作可不是那么容易就能得到的，当然值得一套更好的套装。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就当是我们搬来后的拜访礼，以后还要麻烦各位邻居关照。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能碰上翁贝托先生您这样的好裁缝也是我们的幸运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我知道卢奇诺是个闲不住的孩子，我本来还想把这次狂欢节竞演彩排观众席好位置的票给他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然他不在，就劳您转交给他吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，大家都知道您希望那孩子好，但有时盯他太紧了也不是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总得让他也放松一下，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢，我会转交给他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不说，那孩子的眼睛真的很有灵气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上个月我来排队量体的时候，他还兴冲冲地跟我说，那些来试衣的客人，哪个其实是政府的高官，哪个在为家族做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也很为您能给那些大人物做衣服而自豪呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的确聪明。但德蒙塔诺的客人，不，叙拉古这些裁缝店的客人，其实多数都是普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们来店里量身定做一套套装的机会并不多，为一份难得的工作、一桩美好的姻缘，甚至一次像样的葬礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们配得上这份体面，德蒙塔诺也想赚这点口碑，这样生意才能做得长久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很佩服您，翁贝托先生。有您这样的好老师，卢奇诺将来会是一位好裁缝的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“卢奇诺，别松开我的手。”\n“今后，你愿意和我一起生活吗？”\n“......”\n翁贝托在农场里找到这个满脸泥污的孩子时，他才刚刚过完三岁的生日。\n“......你的眼睛，真像他——我的儿子。”\n“你哭......哭......？”\n孩子好奇地伸手抹去翁贝托的眼泪，却留下一道灰灰的脏印子。\n“卢奇诺，爷爷向你发誓，我绝不会允许你爸爸这样的意外再次发生——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您看上去很憔悴，翁贝托先生，需要帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是年龄大了，没有休息好罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安娜，你明天可是第一天上班，总不能光靠新套装来给同事们留下好印象吧，早点休息......对了，这身衣服随时可以拿来店里熨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......今天也准备早点关店去休息一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的邻居","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，再见，翁贝托先生。有事也可以联系我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"翁贝托手中捏着邻居请他转交给卢奇诺的票，瘫坐在缝纫机前，只感到无力。\n沉默片刻后，他拨通了一个号码。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我没理由联系你，但我现在别无他法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢奇诺失踪一天了，我没法去找警察，我害怕那孩子如果真和家族扯上了关系——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能收到这则消息，求你——帮我找到他......他已经是我这个老家伙唯一的牵挂了......英格丽女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g12_saluzzowinery"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月6日    9:00 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅法官，德米特里已经走了，我们需要收队吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您喝多了，您的脸看起来有些红......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉其他同事，继续追踪肇事车辆，而我们继续排查有嫌疑的对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像这样锁定嫌疑人会很困难......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。德米特里，阿尔贝托，“失踪的司机”......很多人都有动手的嫌疑，但我怀疑事情背后还有其他隐情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新沃尔西尼建成至今，盯上我们的人很多——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如那位到现在还没有离开的客人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉维妮娅的目光投向角落。\n酒庄的灯光并不暗，但墙边的酒架刚好隔绝出一块阴影，阴影里只坐着一位沃尔珀。\n她已经喝完了半瓶酒，始终和周围的酒客保持着恰到好处的距离，甚至没人注意到她的刀就那么放在桌面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伪装的警察A","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来您不愿意收队，是为了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的沃尔珀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅大法官，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，你今天的行动——还有这些有点愣头青的警察们，让我很头疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来只是想从管不住嘴巴的酒客那打听一些我感兴趣的消息，但事实就是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我能指望上的人，只有你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道我的名字，还有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先坐下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不是故意偷听你们谈话。法官和家族首领，实在是过于经典的组合了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃尔珀女性指着自己大得有些夸张的耳朵，无奈地撇了撇嘴角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该说它给我带来了更多的方便，还是困扰呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微醺的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦对了，英格丽——我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这下我们扯平了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i04_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看你盯着这把刀看了很久——只是一件工艺品，如果需要的话，我可以马上去市政厅报备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"离开太久了，有些新规则一下子还不适应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......英格丽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想你很清楚，围上来的这些警界新星还做不到什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们都是你的手下？在新沃尔西尼，警察和法官是一个单位的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i04_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特殊时期，特殊办法。况且，他们都是尊重自己职业的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们很乐意陪同你去做身份登记，英格丽女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然，不过得在忙完我自己的事情之后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不会花很长时间的，拉维妮娅......如今我只是来这做客的客人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"英格丽抿了一口酒，任由对面的法官检查自己的刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了参加狂欢节？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了我的女儿，她受伤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病，一场意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么问题吗？我都可以配合回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i04_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"英格丽女士，希望你不要误会，这不是审讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。我以前和法官打过交道，对这个职业没什么特别的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的尊重不是对一位急于破案的法官，而是对一个心系病人安危的好心人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道那场车祸的事情，我们可没向外界透露过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，我的耳朵很灵，拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“还在昏迷”的是你的亲人？很重要的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，无可奉告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，看来叙拉古真是个容易发生意外的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必对我戒心这么重，拉维妮娅。我可以向你保证，这次回来，我决不想和任何家族的事务扯上关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......说不定，我们还能有交换情报的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人的谈话被推门声打断，新的客人站在门口，侍酒师快步上前，躬身去接对方脱下的外套。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，英格丽女士，你果然在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要找到你可真不容易......我把在德蒙塔诺遇到你的事告诉了老家主，他特意叮嘱我说想见——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i04_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"新的客人看向拉维妮娅所在的方向，突然截住了话头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i04_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉维妮娅和英格丽同时看向这个毛毛躁躁的客人，周围伪装成酒客的警察们也都齐刷刷地盯住了这个不速之客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍酒师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，本酒庄为贵客准备的酒已经醒好了，我可以带您过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不、不用了，我突然想起来还有点事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍酒师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那请稍等，我赠送您一瓶酒庄的新品——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的家族成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"突然想起来我家的牙兽今天下崽，我得回去看看！"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉维妮娅看着他手忙脚乱地从侍酒师手中抢过外套重新穿上，临走之前，还没忘记向自己行一个标准的脱帽礼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i04_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个人，上半年因为恶意滋事被判了三个月，没想到已经放出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然，完全是他自己一时上头，和威尼斯载具公司“完全没有干系”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法官大人，我在想我是不是应该对你更尊敬些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以前在叙拉古，可见不到这些人如此害怕一位法官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，英格丽女士，其实我更喜欢你的态度——“对这个职业没什么特别的看法”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古应该敬畏的是法律本身，而不是某些人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，很新颖的说法——但恐怕我得先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去见你以前的家主？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我没义务向一位法官汇报我的每一项行程，但我不想看到你为难，拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，这次回来，我并不想和家族扯上关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我自己有更要紧的事，我会赶在身份登记的截止时间前办完的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，少喝点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的酒量并不好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉维妮娅目送着沃尔珀离开，并用眼神示意那些想要跟上的警察坐下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她认得你们了，交给其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派人去调查威尼斯载具公司，他们的老家主看来也已经到新沃尔西尼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莱昂，事情恐怕越来越麻烦了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅法官，技术部门的同事刚刚传来了这份事故现场附近的资料，需要您看一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那周围的监控不是坏了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是监控。有辆私家车因为故障在那附近停了好几天，行车记录仪刚好拍下了一些东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时，巷子里出现了可疑的人，您看，从体型判断应该是沃尔珀，持刀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她刚刚从这里离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
